Boil Water Notice canceled for Kilauea on Sept. 12

L=C4=AAHU=CA=BBE =E2=80=93 The Department of Water (DOW) has canceled the p=
recautionary Boil Water Notice for the Kilauea Water System, effective imme=
diately.

Date: September 12, 2026

To: Consumers of the Kilauea Water System

Boil Water Notice canceled for Kilauea.

Laboratory results on the samples collected on September 11, 2026, indicate=
 the water is safe for consumption. No further customer action is required =
at this time and customers in the Kilauea area may now resume normal water =
use.

The Boil Water Notice was issued as a precautionary measure following the a=
ftermath of Hurricane Lowell.

For more information or to view updates, please visit www.kauaiwater.org.

