<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">To: Consumers of t=
he Kilauea Water System</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">Boil Water Notice =
canceled for Kilauea.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">Laboratory results=
 on the samples collected on September 11, 2026, indicate the water is safe=
 for consumption. No further customer action is required at this time and c=
ustomers in the Kilauea area may now resume normal water use.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
